## Architecture
Single IIFE. A launcher button (`xBalancer`) is injected into the TW page header. Clicking it calls `window.TM_WH_BALANCER.run()` which opens a `Dialog.show()` popup and runs the balancer.

**Main execution pipeline in `runComputationAndRender()`:**
```
fetchIncomingOverview()          → incomingRes (Map: villageId → {wood,stone,iron})
fetchProdOverview()              → rawVillagesData (array of village objects)
apply reservePerVillage          → villagesData (stocks reduced by reserve)
apply pendingSends               → adjusts stocks for already-dispatched sends
computeTotalsAndAverages()       → averages (fleet-wide wood/stone/iron avg)
computeExcessShortage()          → excessResources[], shortageResources[]
applyManualCoordLocks()          → zeroes locked resources (both excess & shortage)
applyPpResourceLock()            → zeroes PP-locked resources
[if hqPriorityEnabled]
  fetchHqNextBuilding() × N      → hqData Map (sequential, 300ms gap, skips maxedOut & lowPoints villages)
  applyHqBuildPriority()         → boosts shortage for empty-queue villages; respects all locks
assignMerchantsAndBuildLinks()   → links[]
normalizeAndCombineLinks()       → deduped Map-based merge
addDistanceToLinks()             → adds distance field, sorts by distance
[maxDistance filter]
renderRows()                     → send list table with [HQ] badge on priority targets
[PP plan building if no persisted plans]
```

